### Manam User Management API - Test File
### This file contains all API endpoints with mock JSON payloads for testing
### Use with REST Client extension in VS Code

### ========================================
### ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES
### ========================================
@baseUrl = https://localhost:7001/api/v1
@contentType = application/json

# These will be set after successful login
@token = your-jwt-token-here
@userId = 1
@refreshToken = your-refresh-token-here

###
### ========================================
### AUTHENTICATION ENDPOINTS
### ========================================

### 1. REGISTER NEW USER
POST {{baseUrl}}/authentication/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "johndoe123",
  "email": "john.doe@example.com",
  "password": "MyPassword123!",
  "confirmPassword": "MyPassword123!",
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "phoneNumber": "+1-555-0123456"
}

###

### 2. LOGIN USER
POST {{baseUrl}}/authentication/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "john.doe@example.com",
  "password": "MyPassword123!",
  "ipAddress": "192.168.1.1",
  "userAgent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64)"
}

###

### 3. REGISTER WITH VALIDATION ERROR (Missing Special Character)
POST {{baseUrl}}/authentication/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "jane123",
  "email": "jane@example.com",
  "password": "MyPassword123",
  "confirmPassword": "MyPassword123",
  "firstName": "Jane",
  "lastName": "Smith"
}

###

### 4. LOGIN WITH INVALID CREDENTIALS
POST {{baseUrl}}/authentication/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "nonexistent@example.com",
  "password": "WrongPassword123!",
  "ipAddress": "192.168.1.100",
  "userAgent": "PostmanRuntime/7.28.0"
}

###

### 5. FORGOT PASSWORD REQUEST
POST {{baseUrl}}/authentication/forgot-password?email=john.doe@example.com

###

### 6. RESET PASSWORD
POST {{baseUrl}}/authentication/reset-password
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "token": "password-reset-token-from-email",
  "newPassword": "NewPassword123!",
  "confirmPassword": "NewPassword123!"
}

###

### 7. VERIFY EMAIL
POST {{baseUrl}}/authentication/verify-email/1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

###

###
### ========================================
### USER PROFILE ENDPOINTS (PROTECTED)
### Requires JWT Token in Authorization header
### ========================================

### 8. GET CURRENT USER PROFILE
GET {{baseUrl}}/userprofile/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 9. GET SPECIFIC USER PROFILE (By ID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/userprofile/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 10. GET ALL USERS (PAGINATED - Admin Only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/userprofile?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 11. UPDATE USER PROFILE
PUT {{baseUrl}}/userprofile/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Smith-Doe",
  "phoneNumber": "+1-555-9876543"
}

###

### 12. UPDATE ANOTHER USER (Admin Only)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/userprofile/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "firstName": "Jane",
  "lastName": "Johnson",
  "phoneNumber": "+1-555-5555555"
}

###

### 13. DELETE CURRENT USER (Soft Delete)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/userprofile/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 14. DELETE ANOTHER USER (Admin Only - Soft Delete)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/userprofile/3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 15. LINK EXTERNAL PROVIDER (Google, Facebook, GitHub)
POST {{baseUrl}}/userprofile/link-provider
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "providerId": 1,
  "externalUserId": "google-user-id-12345",
  "externalEmail": "john.doe@gmail.com",
  "accessToken": "google-access-token-abc123def456"
}

###

### 16. LINK FACEBOOK PROVIDER
POST {{baseUrl}}/userprofile/link-provider
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "providerId": 2,
  "externalUserId": "facebook-user-id-98765",
  "externalEmail": "john.doe@facebook.com",
  "accessToken": "facebook-access-token-xyz789"
}

###

### 17. LINK GITHUB PROVIDER
POST {{baseUrl}}/userprofile/link-provider
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "providerId": 3,
  "externalUserId": "github-username-johndoe",
  "externalEmail": null,
  "accessToken": "github-personal-access-token-ghu_abc123"
}

###

### 18. ASSIGN ADMIN ROLE TO USER (Admin Only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/userprofile/2/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "roleId": 1,
  "roleName": "Admin"
}

###

### 19. ASSIGN MODERATOR ROLE
POST {{baseUrl}}/userprofile/3/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "roleId": 3,
  "roleName": "Moderator"
}

###

### 20. ASSIGN GUEST ROLE
POST {{baseUrl}}/userprofile/4/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "roleId": 4,
  "roleName": "Guest"
}

###

###
### ========================================
### ERROR HANDLING TEST CASES
### ========================================

### 21. LOGIN WITHOUT TOKEN (Should Fail)
GET {{baseUrl}}/userprofile/me

###

### 22. INVALID TOKEN (Should Fail)
GET {{baseUrl}}/userprofile/me
Authorization: Bearer invalid-token-xyz

###

### 23. EXPIRED TOKEN (Should Fail)
GET {{baseUrl}}/userprofile/me
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiIxIiwiZXhwIjoxNjAwMDAwMDAwfQ.invalid_expired_token

###

### 24. ACCESS ADMIN ENDPOINT AS REGULAR USER (Should Fail)
GET {{baseUrl}}/userprofile?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 25. DELETE OTHER USER AS REGULAR USER (Should Fail)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/userprofile/5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

###
### ========================================
### BATCH TEST - COMPLETE WORKFLOW
### ========================================

### STEP 1: Register New User
### Copy the userId from response
POST {{baseUrl}}/authentication/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "testuser2025",
  "email": "testuser@example.com",
  "password": "TestPassword123!",
  "confirmPassword": "TestPassword123!",
  "firstName": "Test",
  "lastName": "User",
  "phoneNumber": "+1-555-0000001"
}

###

### STEP 2: Login with New User
### Copy the JWT token from response
POST {{baseUrl}}/authentication/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "testuser@example.com",
  "password": "TestPassword123!",
  "ipAddress": "192.168.100.50",
  "userAgent": "TestClient/1.0"
}

###

### STEP 3: Get Profile with Token
### Paste token from Step 2
GET {{baseUrl}}/userprofile/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### STEP 4: Update Profile
PUT {{baseUrl}}/userprofile/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "firstName": "UpdatedTest",
  "lastName": "UpdatedUser",
  "phoneNumber": "+1-555-1111111"
}

###

### STEP 5: Link Google Account
POST {{baseUrl}}/userprofile/link-provider
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "providerId": 1,
  "externalUserId": "google-abc123xyz",
  "externalEmail": "testuser@gmail.com",
  "accessToken": "ya29.a0AfH6SMBx..."
}

###

### STEP 6: Get Updated Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/userprofile/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### STEP 7: Delete User Account (Soft Delete)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/userprofile/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

